<title>USA: CME average feeder steer price.</title>
<headline>CME average feeder steer price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported the average feeder steer price for the seven calendar days ending Thursday, April 24 used for cash settlement of CME Feeder Cattle contracts. (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>12-STATES - FOR 7 DAYS ENDING -</p>
<p>Thursday     April 24 $72.78    up 0.24</p>
<p>Wednesday    April 23 $72.54    up 0.39</p>
</text>
